## 1. Purpose

**Shown when:** a supplier taps "Withdraw" on `S-F05-01` (Loyalty and payout balance) to request a cash-out of their accumulated payout balance or to check the status of previous withdrawal requests.

**The user leaves this screen when:** they tap "Back" (from any state, including after submitting a withdrawal request) to return to `S-F05-01`.

